{"id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-jump-operator.md","title":"跳跃算子 $J$","display":"df-jump-operator — 跳跃算子 $J$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-jump-operator","aliases":["91-df-jump-operator","91-df-Kripke-jump"],"display":"df-jump-operator — 跳跃算子 $J$","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","[[91-df-strong-kleene]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-jump-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-jump-operator</span><span>91-df-Kripke-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jump-operator — 跳跃算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (带真理谓词的语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\)</span> (信息一致性, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\">\\(v_X:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\\)</span> (强 Kleene 真值函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\\coloneqq\n\\{X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\\coloneqq\n\\{X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\}\\)</span> (一致信息偏序)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\nJ(X)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\n\\right\\},\n\\qquad\nJ:\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\\to\\operatorname{Info}_{c}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\nJ(X)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land v_X(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\n\\right\\},\n\\qquad\nJ:\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\\to\\operatorname{Info}_{c}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> : 跳跃算子（Kripke跳跃）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}(\\mathbb{N})\">\\(\\mathcal{P}(\\mathbb{N})\\)</span> : 自然数幂集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^X\">\\(T^X\\)</span> : 真理谓词解释为集合<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：跳跃算子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>将一个真理集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>映射到新的真理集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(X)\">\\(J(X)\\)</span>，表示在解释<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T = X\">\\(T = X\\)</span>下为真的句子编码集。</p>\n<p>跳跃算子的性质：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>信息单调性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq Y\">\\(X\\subseteq Y\\)</span> 时，已有真、假信息不会丢失，因此\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(X)\\subseteq J(Y)\">\\(J(X)\\subseteq J(Y)\\)</span>；这是一条关于整个算子的定理，不只是正公式结论。</li>\n<li><strong>自指</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(X)\">\\(J(X)\\)</span>包含那些&quot;在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=X\">\\(T=X\\)</span>解释下自认为真&quot;的句子</li>\n<li><strong>固定点</strong>：存在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>使得<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(X) = X\">\\(J(X) = X\\)</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p>跳跃算子的单调性是随后需要证明的性质，不是定义式的合取项；固定点一般需要超穷迭代，不能预设在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>阶段达到。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\)</span>，强 Kleene 跳跃保持一致性。\n从空信息迭代所得极小固定点因而是一致部分解释。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 扩展到整个\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>，也会出现含真值过剩的不一致固定点；谈论\n“所有固定点”时必须说明是否限制在一致固定点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on",